Functionality included in the project:
Feature Engineering


1) Standardization class
    - Create a Standardization object
    - Call the fit method to find mean,std dev from training data
    - Use the transform method to transform the respective data
2) Normalization classes
    - Contains sub-classes for Normalization
    - includes min-max, robust, absoulte and mean scaler
3) Encoding
    - For non numerical columns we can not scale, we need Encoding
    - For ordinal columns where heirarchy exists -> Ordinal Encoding
    - For nominal columns where heirarchy does not exist -> One Hot Encoding
